  "review_notes": [
    "All thirteen native views regenerated from the same verified raised-pavilion model, visually reviewed and promoted from ignored work output.",
    "Rear open/closed and counter open/closed pairs use matching cameras and actual modeled panel travel.",
    "Raised 3:12 living/dining roof, lower 1:12 wings, high glazing, genuine vault and exposed driftwood agree across exterior/interior views and measured section.",
    "The attached pergola covers the 30-foot opening with two outer posts and no house-side posts; architectural timber is coordinated with the exposed interior frames.",
    "Thirty-seven shared asset versions match actual adoption, including four new reusable variations. Five linked full limestone panels and 31 mesh-derived perimeter cuts are separately verified.",
    "Reopened lighting checks confirm 25 actual recessed holes, pendant mounting/headroom and broad fill emitters wholly inside rooms. Exterior artifacts found during drafts are absent from selected views.",
    "Independent specialist review approved current terrace, kitchen, front arrival, roof/site and west-side native views; independent documentation/skill review found no concrete defects.",
    "All ten PDF pages rendered and visually inspected; current furnished floor/site drawings and the measured roof section include actual frame posts and roof data.",
    "Built-in Imagegen exterior and two interior studies derive from the current native sources. Invented exterior upper-floor cues and a changed outdoor table were corrected. Fine materials, lighting, backdrop, foliage and small details remain photographic interpretations.",
    "Gallery coverage check passed all six homes, including source/hash/provenance registration for separate interior photographic studies; checked document links resolve."
  ],
  "limitations": "Architectural concept and editable visualization. Spans, member cores, connections, pergola ledger/footings, roof assemblies, wind/flood exposure, waterproofing, drainage capacity/outfall, corrosion, condensation, site conditions, selected-product operation, accessibility and jurisdiction approval remain unresolved. Slatted pergola provides shade, not rain protection. AI studies are not exact geometry evidence or photographs of a built house."
